Welcome to Alpine on Apple iPad mini 1st gen (P105AP / S5L8942X).

  Both cores, touch, Wi-Fi and the USB network work; @ROOT@

  wifi            Wi-Fi: scan, connect, remember networks
  ios             iOS's own System partition, read-only, straight off the NAND
  apk             packages, over the USB network or Wi-Fi
  poweroff        shuts the system down
  volume buttons  brightness control
  power button    turns off backlight & touch input, second press reverts

